{"unit_id": "tag:01MM:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n我们将利用引理<REF_0001>构造一些典范（canonical）映射（maps）。由于<MATH_0001>，可知存在典范（canonical）映射（maps）\n<MATH_0002>\n这些映射（maps）一般不是同构（isomorphisms），见注记<REF_0002>中的例子。同一例子还表明，<MATH_0003>一般<TEXTITOPEN_0001>不<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>是<MATH_0004>上的可逆（invertible）层（sheaf）。与任意<MATH_0005>-模（module）<MATH_0006>作张量积（Tensoring），得到映射（maps）\n<MATH_0007>\n映射（maps）（<REF_0003>）在整体截面（global sections）上给出一个映射（map），它保持分次（graded）环（rings）结构\n<MATH_0008>\n而对于任意<MATH_0009>-模（module）<MATH_0010>，映射（maps）（<REF_0004>）给出分次（graded）模（module）结构\n<MATH_0011>\n并通过（<REF_0005>）还给出一个<MATH_0012>-模（module）结构。更一般地，给定任意分次（graded）<MATH_0013>-模（module）<MATH_0014>，有<MATH_0015>。因此得到映射（maps）\n<MATH_0016>\n在整体截面（global sections）上，（<REF_0006>）定义了一个映射（map），它保持分次（graded）<MATH_0017>-模（modules）结构\n<MATH_0018>\n下面是一个重要事实，基本上可以直接由定义得出。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "Tensoring", "target_term": "张量积"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "global sections", "target_term": "整体截面"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "global sections", "target_term": "整体截面"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范", "context": "限定拟构造的映射。"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指将用前述引理构造的映射。"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范", "context": "限定由所述关系得到的映射。"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指由所述关系得到的映射。"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "回指上式中的典范映射。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构", "context": "指前述映射一般不具备的性质。"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆", "context": "限定例子所否定的一般层性质。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "指反例中的对象所属类别。"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "指作张量积时任取的对象。"}, {"source_term": "Tensoring", "target_term": "张量积", "context": "指用任意给定的模构造下一组映射的运算。"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指作张量积所得的映射。"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指在整体截面上诱导分次环映射的那组映射。"}, {"source_term": "global sections", "target_term": "整体截面", "context": "指取得分次环映射所用的截面。"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指在整体截面上得到的分次环映射。"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "限定该映射所保持的环结构。"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环", "context": "指该映射的源和目标所带的代数结构。"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "指随后赋予分次模结构时任取的对象。"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指给出下一式中分次模结构的那组映射。"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "限定由所列映射给出的模结构。"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "指由所列映射给出的结构类型。"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "指又经所引映射得到的结构类型。"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "限定更一般情形下任取的模。"}, {"source_term": "module", "target